- Project: {{with .ProjectName}}{{.}}{{else}}{{.Project}}{{end}}{{if and .ProjectName (ne .ProjectName .Project)}} (`{{.Project}}` in refs, commands and URLs){{end}}
- Repository: `{{.Root}}`
